# Shell scripts must stay LF: a CRLF checkout breaks `customize.sh` / the KSU
# property-layer zip ("syntax error: unexpected end of file"), because sh sees
# a stray \r. Windows checkouts were shipping CRLF blobs -> broken zip.
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.prop          text eol=lf
*.xml           text eol=lf
*.jks           binary
*.keystore      binary